WEBVTT

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.181
MISSION 44
"IT'S JUST THE ARRIVAL OF WINTER."

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.701
-DING!
-FLINCH

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.214
CRASH

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:51.676
TREMBLE

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.344
SHE HIT HER FOREHEAD.

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:55.805
ONE NEW MESSAGE

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:03.438
MAID CAFE ITAN WAS A HUGE SUCCESS!
FOR KOMI

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:24.542
FROM: NAJIMI OSANA
BRING THE NOTEBOOK I ASKED YOU TO PREPARE.

00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:26.503
NUMBER 4
OCTOBER TO NOVEMBER

00:01:29.839 --> 00:01:32.133
<i>HOW TO COMMUNICATE</i>
<i>EVEN MONKEYS CAN TALK</i>

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.544
KOMI

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:12.215
-ICY TOUCH
-FLINCH

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.843
Hey-ho, Komi!

00:02:22.058 --> 00:02:25.395
FIDGET

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:27.981
-Good morning Ko…
-STARTLE

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:33.111
Oh, yeah.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:40.326
<i>When a person has extreme social anxiety,</i>

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.163
<i>they struggle to communicate with others.</i>

00:02:44.372 --> 00:02:45.498
<i>Bear in mind…</i>

00:02:45.582 --> 00:02:46.416
NERVOUS

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:47.500
Hm?

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:52.505
<i>What's up with Komi?</i>

00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:54.591
<i>Did something happen?</i>

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:56.259
-ICY TOUCH
-FLINCH

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:12.191
<i>Bear in mind.</i>

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:17.238
<i>They only struggle to form connections.</i>

00:03:17.739 --> 00:03:22.869
<i>It doesn't mean they don't want to.</i>

00:03:22.952 --> 00:03:24.078
However…

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:29.459
<i>Komi still doesn't know.</i>

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:33.171
<i>She doesn't know</i>
<i>the harsh fate that awaits her.</i>

00:03:33.671 --> 00:03:37.133
<i>This well-known hellscape,</i>
<i>Itan Private High School.</i>

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:41.721
<i>Though it's a famous high school,</i>
<i>entrance is based on interviews only.</i>

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.724
<i>To pass, students must be unique.</i>

00:03:44.807 --> 00:03:45.808
<i>In other words…</i>

00:03:46.309 --> 00:03:47.227
<i>freaks,</i>

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.269
<i>weirdos,</i>

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:49.604
<i>loners,</i>

00:03:49.687 --> 00:03:50.813
<i>miscreants…</i>

00:03:53.983 --> 00:03:56.903
and eccentrics fill the school.

00:03:58.279 --> 00:03:59.989
<i>Great rivals.</i>

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:02.867
-<i>Tender moments.</i>
-YAMAI IS OBSESSED

00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:07.413
But can our heroine
survive this battlefield?

00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:09.791
Do it! 100 friends!

00:04:09.874 --> 00:04:11.876
Do it! Be a master of communication!

00:04:12.502 --> 00:04:15.213
What fate will befall Komi?

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.175
What are you doing?

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:22.720
Yeah! Anyway, Komi. Did you bring it?

00:04:23.221 --> 00:04:26.099
I sent you a message this morning.
You know!

00:04:28.142 --> 00:04:28.977
NUMBER 4
OCTOBER TO NOVEMBER

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.603
Oh, great!

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:31.521
What's that?

00:04:32.188 --> 00:04:34.565
The people these past six months who…

00:04:34.649 --> 00:04:35.942
-Never mind.
-Huh?

00:04:36.025 --> 00:04:37.485
We'll use this to make…

00:04:37.568 --> 00:04:40.738
-Ta-da! Komi's Book of Friends!
-JUST A MEMO PAD

00:04:40.822 --> 00:04:42.907
Isn't that a copyright violation?

00:04:42.991 --> 00:04:44.158
The rules are simple!

00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:47.412
Give it to your friends
and they write their names!

00:04:47.495 --> 00:04:48.579
But why?

00:04:48.663 --> 00:04:49.914
Why not!

00:04:49.998 --> 00:04:52.583
It'll be like a nature guide! It's fun!

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:53.918
Here, Komi!

00:04:57.672 --> 00:05:00.967
KOMI'S BOOK OF FRIENDS

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:20.528
HITOHITO TADANO
NAJIMI OSANA

00:05:24.073 --> 00:05:25.199
HIGH FIVE

00:05:32.081 --> 00:05:33.958
HIMIKO AGARI

00:05:38.963 --> 00:05:40.840
REN YAMAI

00:05:40.923 --> 00:05:43.551
RUMBLE

00:05:43.634 --> 00:05:45.511
MAKERU YADANO

00:05:46.095 --> 00:05:48.514
GLANCE

00:06:00.902 --> 00:06:02.779
OMOHARU NAKANAKA

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:06.074
-STARE
-STARTLE

00:06:06.157 --> 00:06:07.784
AKAKO ONIGASHIMA
HIMEKO KISHI

00:06:11.079 --> 00:06:12.705
SHIGEO CHIARAI, TAISEI SONODA
MONO SHINOBINO

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.126
NENE ONEMINE

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.047
KAEDE OTORI

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.007
TADANO, NAJIMI, AGARI, YAMAI,
YADANO, NAKANAKA, ONIGASHIMA

00:06:23.091 --> 00:06:24.967
KISHI, CHIARAI, SONODA,
SHINOBINO, ONEMINE, OTORI

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:40.817
"AO 100 SHOKU"

00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:43.569
Done already?

00:06:43.653 --> 00:06:47.073
-NOT TRYING TO BE MEAN
-<i>To reach 100 she needs 87 more.</i>

00:06:47.156 --> 00:06:47.990
TREMBLE

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:50.409
-It's already been six months.
-THAT'S PRETTY SLOW.

00:06:53.996 --> 00:06:56.207
MISSION 45
"IT'S JUST A DELINQUENT."

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:59.043
<i>My name is Makoto Katai.</i>

00:06:59.127 --> 00:07:00.670
<i>I'm a regular high schooler.</i>

00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:03.464
<i>My favorite food is Hamburg steak.</i>

00:07:03.548 --> 00:07:05.133
<i>My least favorite is green peppers.</i>

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:08.886
<i>I'm a late bloomer, and kind of shy.</i>

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:12.390
<i>I'm not good at taking the initiative.</i>

00:07:13.558 --> 00:07:15.643
<i>But I'm a normal high schooler.</i>

00:07:15.726 --> 00:07:17.270
IS KATAI A THUG?

00:07:17.353 --> 00:07:18.354
STAFF ROOM

00:07:21.315 --> 00:07:22.984
<i>That was nerve-wracking…</i>

00:07:24.902 --> 00:07:28.781
<i>I was so nervous asking where my class is!</i>

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:31.367
-<i>It started six months ago.</i>
-SIX MONTHS AGO

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:33.202
<i>The first day of school.</i>

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:37.540
<i>I had caught a cold</i>
<i>and spent a week in bed.</i>

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:40.042
<i>I didn't attend the first week of class.</i>

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:42.753
-<i>It was hard to go, even after recovering.</i>
-HE DID COME TO THE GATE

00:07:42.837 --> 00:07:44.255
<i>I'll go tomorrow.</i>

00:07:44.338 --> 00:07:46.132
<i>I'll go tomorrow.</i>

00:07:46.841 --> 00:07:48.551
<i>Tomorrow I'll go to school…</i>

00:07:49.343 --> 00:07:50.470
<i>is what I told myself.</i>

00:07:50.553 --> 00:07:52.180
-<i>And now look at the season!</i>
-THUNK

00:07:52.263 --> 00:07:53.431
<i>Early winter.</i>

00:07:54.182 --> 00:07:57.435
<i>But over summer break, I changed!</i>

00:07:57.518 --> 00:07:59.562
-<i>I started working out.</i>
-500 more! You can do it!

00:07:59.645 --> 00:08:02.732
<i>I dyed my hair too,</i>
<i>to keep the bullies away.</i>

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:05.860
<i>I don't look like a dropout at all!</i>

00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:07.570
<i>I'm just…</i>

00:08:07.653 --> 00:08:10.114
<i>Just a normal high schooler!</i>

00:08:11.616 --> 00:08:13.910
<i>Alright. Here I go!</i>

00:08:17.788 --> 00:08:19.457
<i>I can't. I'm so nervous!</i>

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.210
-<i>He's looking in our class!</i>
-<i>Scary!</i>

00:08:22.293 --> 00:08:24.670
<i>No. It's fine.</i>

00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:25.922
<i>Today's the day I…</i>

00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:28.132
THUD

00:08:29.634 --> 00:08:30.927
OUCH

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.220
He kicked the door…

00:08:32.303 --> 00:08:33.471
Who could that be?

00:08:33.554 --> 00:08:34.972
What's his deal?

00:08:35.473 --> 00:08:37.391
-VERY, VERY NERVOUS.
-<i>He's angry!</i>

00:08:48.778 --> 00:08:49.612
LEER

00:08:53.908 --> 00:08:54.784
TADANO'S PERSPECTIVE

00:08:54.867 --> 00:08:56.410
<i>Oh no.</i>

00:08:56.494 --> 00:08:59.288
<i>I forgot to ask where my desk is.</i>

00:08:59.789 --> 00:09:02.792
<i>I don't want to wait up front.</i>
<i>I'll go to the back.</i>

00:09:03.417 --> 00:09:05.503
<i>I'll wait for the teacher here.</i>

00:09:05.586 --> 00:09:08.965
<i>Everyone's looking at me.</i>

00:09:09.048 --> 00:09:10.967
-<i>Oh! I should smile!</i>
-LEER

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:14.178
-TADANO FIGURED HIM OUT.
-<i>So that's what he's thinking!</i>

00:09:14.262 --> 00:09:16.347
What's his deal?

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.015
Someone talk to him!

00:09:18.099 --> 00:09:20.142
-Hey-ho!
-Huh?

00:09:20.226 --> 00:09:21.727
Oh! Katai?

00:09:21.811 --> 00:09:23.854
-Long time no see!
-Our savior!

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:27.441
-<i>Najimi knows everyone.</i>
-When did I see you last?

00:09:27.525 --> 00:09:28.985
Anyway, besides that.

00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:30.528
You've really cha-- Gurk!

00:09:30.611 --> 00:09:34.156
<i>I can't have everyone</i>
<i>knowing about my past.</i>

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.908
<i>I have to explain to Najimi.</i>

00:09:35.992 --> 00:09:38.411
Najimi!

00:09:40.871 --> 00:09:42.498
QUIETLY

00:09:42.582 --> 00:09:45.209
<i>Oh. Gotta smile!</i>

00:09:45.293 --> 00:09:48.337
N-Najimi!

00:09:48.421 --> 00:09:50.798
<i>Najimi went to the restroom.</i>

00:09:50.881 --> 00:09:54.093
-<i>I wonder if someone will talk to me?</i>
-FIDGET

00:09:54.176 --> 00:09:55.011
Huh?

00:09:55.094 --> 00:09:56.554
SWARM

00:09:56.637 --> 00:09:58.764
<i>Everyone's gathered in one spot.</i>

00:09:59.432 --> 00:10:01.934
<i>I guess she's a popular student.</i>

00:10:02.893 --> 00:10:05.688
We must protect Komi at all costs!

00:10:05.771 --> 00:10:07.440
Save her…

00:10:07.523 --> 00:10:08.774
Divine intervention…

00:10:09.525 --> 00:10:11.277
<i>I've got to change.</i>

00:10:12.069 --> 00:10:14.113
<i>I'll go talk to them!</i>

00:10:14.989 --> 00:10:17.283
Yikes! He's coming!

00:10:17.366 --> 00:10:19.493
-She's done for.
-Someone save her!

00:10:19.577 --> 00:10:22.330
We'll protect Komi!

00:10:22.413 --> 00:10:23.914
You guys are…

00:10:23.998 --> 00:10:25.958
-The class delinquents!
-Huh?

00:10:26.042 --> 00:10:27.168
BUMP

00:10:28.961 --> 00:10:31.631
-Day… desk?
-(GOOD) DAY (WHERE'S MY) DESK?

00:10:31.714 --> 00:10:33.924
Die? Death?

00:10:34.008 --> 00:10:36.218
<i>I got phlegm in my throat.</i>

00:10:36.302 --> 00:10:37.803
<i>Did they understand?</i>

00:10:37.887 --> 00:10:39.263
<i>They did not.</i>

00:10:41.015 --> 00:10:43.392
-Useless!
-They're not real delinquents!

00:10:43.476 --> 00:10:45.728
<i>Oh good. They seem alright.</i>

00:10:46.437 --> 00:10:50.733
<i>Now, who were they standing around?</i>

00:10:55.863 --> 00:10:57.073
<i>I…</i>

00:10:57.156 --> 00:10:58.240
<i>I'm scared!</i>

00:10:58.324 --> 00:10:59.659
-TREMBLE
-WHY?

00:11:01.452 --> 00:11:03.704
<i>W-What is this pressure I'm feeling?</i>

00:11:03.788 --> 00:11:06.457
<i>She's looking! At me!</i>

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.376
<i>Why is she staring so much?</i>

00:11:08.459 --> 00:11:10.086
<i>I'm scared!</i>

00:11:10.169 --> 00:11:12.838
<i>My knees are weak.</i>

00:11:12.922 --> 00:11:14.507
He sat down!

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.468
<i>Deep breaths, deep breaths!</i>

00:11:17.551 --> 00:11:19.428
EXHALE

00:11:24.433 --> 00:11:26.435
-<i>She's still staring!</i>
-TOO SCARED TO MOVE

00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:30.106
<i>Everyone usually looks away</i>
<i>when I meet their gaze.</i>

00:11:30.189 --> 00:11:35.277
<i>But this might be the first time</i>
<i>someone looked me in the eyes.</i>

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.071
<i>Oh, right!</i>

00:11:37.154 --> 00:11:40.282
Even Monkeys Can Talk <i>chapter 4, page 116!</i>

00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:43.577
<i>"Get your feelings across</i>
<i>by looking people in the eyes!"</i>

00:11:43.661 --> 00:11:46.789
<i>That's why this person</i>
<i>is looking me in the eyes!</i>

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:50.626
<i>It means she wants to communicate, right?</i>

00:11:51.419 --> 00:11:53.629
<i>Okay! I can do it too!</i>

00:11:56.298 --> 00:12:00.010
-They're glaring at each other.
-It's a stare-down!

00:12:01.637 --> 00:12:02.471
SCARED

00:12:04.098 --> 00:12:04.932
SCARED

00:12:05.015 --> 00:12:05.850
TREMBLE

00:12:05.933 --> 00:12:07.059
Uh.

00:12:07.643 --> 00:12:10.229
Um, you're Katai. Aren't you?

00:12:10.729 --> 00:12:11.647
Huh?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.691
<i>Aaah! No!</i>

00:12:13.774 --> 00:12:16.235
<i>My voice changed and now it's super low.</i>

00:12:16.318 --> 00:12:20.364
<i>If I don't make it higher,</i>
<i>I sound like I'm really mad!</i>

00:12:22.074 --> 00:12:24.702
<i>Now he thinks I'm a jerk.</i>

00:12:25.411 --> 00:12:28.831
You were out of school
for a long time, right?

00:12:29.373 --> 00:12:32.293
If you want, I can show you around!

00:12:32.376 --> 00:12:33.419
Huh?

00:12:39.049 --> 00:12:42.761
I'd… like that.

00:12:54.648 --> 00:12:56.525
This is the music room.

00:12:56.609 --> 00:12:57.776
<i>W-Wow.</i>

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:00.821
-<i>This is the power of eye contact.</i>
-STARE

00:13:00.905 --> 00:13:02.281
-Here is the library.
-LIBRARY

00:13:02.364 --> 00:13:06.994
<i>Walking through the school,</i>
<i>just the two of us.</i>

00:13:07.077 --> 00:13:08.871
<i>We're like real friends!</i>

00:13:08.954 --> 00:13:10.122
-GRIN
-SQUEAL

00:13:10.206 --> 00:13:11.999
Are you listening?

00:13:12.082 --> 00:13:13.209
<i>Oh yeah!</i>

00:13:13.292 --> 00:13:17.588
<i>She was staring in order to tell me.</i>

00:13:18.506 --> 00:13:20.049
The Master of Communication.

00:13:21.217 --> 00:13:26.013
She's Commu, the Master of Communication!

00:13:26.096 --> 00:13:27.264
<i>Go get 'em!</i>

00:13:27.348 --> 00:13:28.474
Commu?

00:13:30.309 --> 00:13:31.143
COMMU

00:13:31.227 --> 00:13:32.186
-Bang!
-COMMUNICATION SKILLS

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:36.899
MISSION 46
"IT'S JUST STUDYING AT NAKANAKA'S."

00:13:36.982 --> 00:13:40.110
That's all everyone. See you tomorrow.

00:13:40.194 --> 00:13:42.071
Let's go out for ramen.

00:13:42.154 --> 00:13:43.322
Sounds good!

00:13:44.657 --> 00:13:46.534
-It's winter!
-A SNOWMAN POSE

00:13:46.617 --> 00:13:48.786
Maybe I just won't ask.

00:13:48.869 --> 00:13:52.122
I thought you hated winter.

00:13:52.206 --> 00:13:53.499
I can't stand the cold.

00:13:53.582 --> 00:13:56.627
But there are lots of fun winter events.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:14:00.965
Christmas, gift money, skiing,
cozy rooms, the Ekiden race! And…

00:14:01.549 --> 00:14:03.175
Term finals!

00:14:03.759 --> 00:14:06.345
-Tests. You're always the same.
-TERM FINALS

00:14:06.428 --> 00:14:09.515
Standing between me and my fun.

00:14:09.598 --> 00:14:11.141
How dare you!

00:14:12.726 --> 00:14:15.854
Oh yeah! We can study at Nakanaka's house!

00:14:16.647 --> 00:14:19.066
<i>They just want to play games.</i>

00:14:19.149 --> 00:14:20.317
NAKANAKA RESIDENCE

00:14:20.401 --> 00:14:24.530
Anyway… You are welcome at my castle.

00:14:24.613 --> 00:14:25.990
But what's up with her?

00:14:26.073 --> 00:14:30.160
Who's she talking about?
We don't know, do we Komi?

00:14:30.244 --> 00:14:31.245
It's you! You!

00:14:31.328 --> 00:14:34.957
Why? We're friends aren't we, Nakanaka?

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:38.502
<i>Forgetting me and inviting Komi?</i>
<i>Unacceptable!</i>

00:14:38.586 --> 00:14:40.963
I don't remember being friends with you.

00:14:41.046 --> 00:14:43.424
<i>You're just jealous that Komi came over.</i>

00:14:43.507 --> 00:14:44.592
<i>You harlot!</i>

00:14:44.675 --> 00:14:46.677
RUMBLE

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:50.639
<i>These two are not very compatible.</i>

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:52.558
Thanks for having me!

00:14:52.641 --> 00:14:53.934
Good night!

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:55.644
Asleep!

00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:57.813
<i>What was the point of this visit?</i>

00:14:57.897 --> 00:14:59.565
So, Komi.

00:15:00.649 --> 00:15:03.110
Sit next to me.

00:15:03.193 --> 00:15:05.905
There's a physics formula
I don't understand..

00:15:05.988 --> 00:15:08.073
N-No! You should sit here.

00:15:08.157 --> 00:15:09.909
That cushion is of poor quality!

00:15:11.452 --> 00:15:14.038
<i>This is how Yamai and Nakanaka</i>

00:15:14.121 --> 00:15:17.583
<i>sparked off their battle for Komi's heart.</i>

00:15:17.666 --> 00:15:19.793
WILD GIRLS
BEAST EARS, THE MOVIE

00:15:24.798 --> 00:15:28.010
I know, Komi! Want to play a game?

00:15:28.093 --> 00:15:29.470
Last time was hard, right?

00:15:29.553 --> 00:15:32.181
I've gathered some games
with easier controls.

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:36.185
<i>Nakanaka's attack:</i>
<i>"For Komi's Benefit."</i>

00:15:36.268 --> 00:15:38.812
<i>I thought we came to study…</i>

00:15:38.896 --> 00:15:40.940
Of course she doesn't want to play.

00:15:41.023 --> 00:15:42.691
-That's such a boyish activity.
-HEH

00:15:43.442 --> 00:15:45.402
-What?
-<i>But it was blocked!</i>

00:15:45.486 --> 00:15:47.237
Girls like romance!

00:15:47.321 --> 00:15:49.156
Komi, who's your crush?

00:15:49.239 --> 00:15:50.532
Mine is you.

00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:52.242
<i>"Practically a Confession!"</i>

00:15:52.326 --> 00:15:55.496
YAMAI'S ATTACK: PRACTICALLY A CONFESSION!

00:15:55.579 --> 00:15:57.498
<i>It's not very effective…</i>

00:15:57.581 --> 00:15:59.208
Um, what about studying?

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.672
That reminds me…

00:16:04.755 --> 00:16:07.967
I noticed when I entered this room.

00:16:08.467 --> 00:16:12.554
The whole interior is black and you have
so many anime and movie posters.

00:16:12.638 --> 00:16:15.516
It's like an otaku boy's room.

00:16:15.599 --> 00:16:16.600
Urgh!

00:16:16.684 --> 00:16:18.018
<i>It's super effective!</i>

00:16:18.102 --> 00:16:19.895
Alright then.

00:16:19.979 --> 00:16:23.065
What do you consider a girly room?

00:16:23.148 --> 00:16:24.733
That's easy.

00:16:24.817 --> 00:16:26.235
You need a big mirror.

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:29.655
Make-up, perfume, pink items,
antique-style furniture.

00:16:29.738 --> 00:16:31.865
And serve jasmine tea, not barley…

00:16:33.742 --> 00:16:34.827
How basic.

00:16:35.619 --> 00:16:37.162
<i>It's super effective!</i>

00:16:37.246 --> 00:16:40.833
Your nails are filthy!
I'm not interested in your opinion.

00:16:40.916 --> 00:16:43.460
You're the one with damaged hair!

00:16:43.544 --> 00:16:45.546
Since you change the color often.

00:16:45.629 --> 00:16:48.465
You live at home,
so I bet you can't even cook!

00:16:48.549 --> 00:16:49.925
So unfeminine.

00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:51.176
-Femininity!
-GIRLS ARE SCARY.

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:54.221
Don't judge me on something
you can't even quantify!

00:16:54.304 --> 00:16:57.558
According to our star charts,
I'm a better match for Komi!

00:16:57.641 --> 00:16:59.435
There you go being basic again!

00:16:59.518 --> 00:17:01.103
There's no evidence!

00:17:01.186 --> 00:17:03.439
Why do you talk like that?

00:17:03.522 --> 00:17:06.525
You do it because
you're an internet addict, right?

00:17:06.608 --> 00:17:09.528
You're as good at
finding information as my mom!

00:17:09.611 --> 00:17:12.239
-How old did you say you were?
-<i>Komi is…</i>

00:17:12.322 --> 00:17:13.490
-Let's calm down…
-Huh?!

00:17:13.574 --> 00:17:14.867
Oh, nothing.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:18.078
Komi, which of us is a better friend?

00:17:18.162 --> 00:17:21.331
<i>And now the spears point at Komi.</i>

00:17:32.051 --> 00:17:33.969
YOU'RE BOTH IMPORTANT TO ME.

00:17:43.479 --> 00:17:45.189
-SECRETLY HAPPY
-FIDGETY

00:17:46.023 --> 00:17:47.608
Y-Yeah, but!

00:17:47.691 --> 00:17:50.444
If you had to choose, who would it be?

00:17:51.653 --> 00:17:54.156
Why not see who gets a higher test score?

00:17:54.239 --> 00:17:55.491
Shut up.

00:17:55.574 --> 00:17:57.659
<i>They're in perfect sync.</i>

00:17:58.786 --> 00:18:02.372
<i>We can't keep asking Komi.</i>

00:18:02.456 --> 00:18:04.291
<i>She'll hate me if I'm aggressive.</i>

00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:06.835
<i>Have you ever not been aggressive?</i>

00:18:06.919 --> 00:18:11.799
Isn't there something?
Some way to settle this?

00:18:12.299 --> 00:18:13.342
Games.

00:18:14.551 --> 00:18:17.096
We have video games!

00:18:20.849 --> 00:18:21.892
Yeah.

00:18:21.975 --> 00:18:24.311
Let's do it!

00:18:24.812 --> 00:18:26.772
-Games!
-Me too!

00:18:28.023 --> 00:18:30.901
Hang on! Don't put a banana there!

00:18:30.984 --> 00:18:34.905
-I'll let my strategy speak for itself!
-Yes, that's it!

00:18:34.988 --> 00:18:37.407
Scoundrel! You're aiming
that red carapace at me!

00:18:37.491 --> 00:18:39.868
Must be your imagination!

00:18:39.952 --> 00:18:41.578
Take that!

00:18:42.287 --> 00:18:44.039
The R button on the right…

00:18:45.124 --> 00:18:47.292
Take that! And that!

00:18:47.376 --> 00:18:49.253
Boom!

00:18:50.379 --> 00:18:51.713
Finish!

00:18:52.422 --> 00:18:55.175
Yay! I win!

00:18:55.259 --> 00:18:58.679
That means Komi's best friend is me!

00:18:59.513 --> 00:19:00.430
BANG

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:04.184
<i>Najimi, why do you have to be like that?</i>

00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:06.812
<i>They competed on their tests too.</i>

00:19:07.354 --> 00:19:08.897
A draw?!

00:19:08.981 --> 00:19:11.859
You've all cleared your desks, right?

00:19:11.942 --> 00:19:13.902
You've got your writing tools?

00:19:13.986 --> 00:19:16.822
If you drop anything
I'll get it, so let me know.

00:19:16.905 --> 00:19:18.866
Now, start!

00:19:40.429 --> 00:19:41.555
WOBBLE

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.227
POP

00:19:49.813 --> 00:19:52.441
<i>Komi only prepared two pencils.</i>

00:19:55.277 --> 00:20:01.533
HAS TO SAY SHE DROPPED HER PENCIL…

00:20:02.784 --> 00:20:05.412
<i>Komi is too shy about standing out</i>
<i>so she can't say it.</i>

00:20:09.166 --> 00:20:12.377
<i>Huh? Komi's…</i>

00:20:12.461 --> 00:20:14.254
<i>not writing…?</i>

00:20:14.338 --> 00:20:15.839
PLOP

00:20:17.341 --> 00:20:19.051
<i>Oh, I get it.</i>

00:20:22.054 --> 00:20:23.931
<i>Around there.</i>

00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:30.270
Teacher? I dropped my mechanical pencil.

00:20:30.354 --> 00:20:33.148
-Huh?
-Uh, sorry.

00:20:33.232 --> 00:20:35.025
Could you get it for me?

00:20:35.108 --> 00:20:36.443
Sure.

00:20:40.239 --> 00:20:42.783
Hm? Is this yours, Komi?

00:20:43.867 --> 00:20:48.080
You're the only one in this class
who uses a pencil, after all. Here.

00:20:50.457 --> 00:20:51.875
<i>All set.</i>

00:20:51.959 --> 00:20:55.170
-Here.
-Oh, thank you.

00:20:57.047 --> 00:20:58.507
JAPANESE HISTORY TERM FINAL
CLASS 1-1, HITOHITO TADANO

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.759
<i>Komi's so clumsy.</i>

00:21:01.343 --> 00:21:02.386
<i>Huh?</i>

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.180
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:21:05.264 --> 00:21:06.098
CLUMSY

00:21:06.181 --> 00:21:08.642
<i>I forgot to get my eraser out!</i>

00:21:08.725 --> 00:21:12.604
I CAN'T MAKE ANY MISTAKES!

00:21:30.539 --> 00:21:31.915
Excuse me!

00:21:31.999 --> 00:21:34.334
I dropped my eraser.

00:21:34.418 --> 00:21:35.877
Again?

00:21:35.961 --> 00:21:37.671
I'm sorry.

00:21:37.754 --> 00:21:38.797
Here.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:41.258
Thank you very much.

00:21:42.259 --> 00:21:44.886
<i>Is this alright?</i>

00:21:54.479 --> 00:21:58.275
<i>Neither of them could focus on the test.</i>

00:21:58.984 --> 00:22:01.403
BONUS SCENE

00:22:10.662 --> 00:22:11.663
Huh?

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:18.879
Hey, lend me your eraser.

00:22:18.962 --> 00:22:20.088
Huh?

00:22:26.094 --> 00:22:27.054
No.

00:22:27.137 --> 00:22:28.513
Huh? Why?

00:22:29.348 --> 00:22:31.475
<i>The eraser became a family heirloom.</i>

00:23:59.896 --> 00:24:01.898
Subtitle translation by: Claire Tanaka
